{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[OFFICIAL MESSAGE \u2013 SAFE ZONE CORP.]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>SAFE ZONE</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This environment has been carefully designed to ensure your well-being. Your cooperation is essential for the successful completion of the experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Safe Zone</i> is a platforming experience with psychological and narrative elements. You will undergo a series of simulations where death is not a failure, but part of the process. The goal is not to survive \u2014 it is to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MARA, our artificial intelligence assistant, will guide you at all times. She knows what you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experiment features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2D platform simulations with mechanics based on observation, trial and adaptation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Symbolic and emotional narrative with multiple layers of interpretation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist design to eliminate unnecessary distractions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedrun mode authorized for subjects with high stress tolerance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the end, everything will be okay. And if it\u2019s not okay... it\u2019s not the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 <i>SAFE ZONE CORP.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your participation.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699100?t=1747717888","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699100?t=1747717888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699100/53eb46db4c72ea87c95f3a1c8497339019c77752/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747717888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699100/53eb46db4c72ea87c95f3a1c8497339019c77752/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747717888","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game explores psychological themes such as anxiety, depression, and the desire to give up, including metaphorical references to death and despair. However, it does not contain graphic violence, sexual content, or real-world depictions of self-harm. The content is presented in a symbolic and abstract way, through minimalist visuals and short narrative texts."},"demos":[{"appid":3703220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[OFFICIAL MESSAGE \u2013 SAFE ZONE CORP.]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>SAFE ZONE</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This environment has been carefully designed to ensure your well-being. Your cooperation is essential for the successful completion of the experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Safe Zone</i> is a platforming experience with psychological and narrative elements. You will undergo a series of simulations where death is not a failure, but part of the process. The goal is not to survive \u2014 it is to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MARA, our artificial intelligence assistant, will guide you at all times. She knows what you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experiment features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2D platform simulations with mechanics based on observation, trial and adaptation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Symbolic and emotional narrative with multiple layers of interpretation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist design to eliminate unnecessary distractions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedrun mode authorized for subjects with high stress tolerance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the end, everything will be okay. And if it\u2019s not okay... it\u2019s not the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 <i>SAFE ZONE CORP.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your participation.</p>","developers":["Jibakurei Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699100/5e0c7796f88c947b6eeff87de1dcc2d741d45462/header.jpg?t=1747717888","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140372,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140372/movie480.mp4?t=1747349844","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140372/movie_max.mp4?t=1747349844"},"name":"SAFE ZONE Oficial Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140372/7b8a875cfcb60da69123023bad9d9c00c14692ae/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747349844","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140372/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747349844","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140372/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747349844"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257139937,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139937/movie480.mp4?t=1747266017","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139937/movie_max.mp4?t=1747266017"},"name":"SAFE ZONE Trailer Oficial","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257139937/19fed8f67a844168eff44c088ce4c21dc94b3807/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747266017","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139937/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747266017","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139937/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747266017"}}],"name":"SAFE ZONE","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_l